      <Desc>THE COLUMBIA COMMUNITY FOUNDATION (CCF) RECEIVES FUNDING THROUGH THE CITY OF SAN DIEGO'S COMMUNITY PARKING DISTRICT PROGRAM, WHOSE MISSION IS TO HELP BRING PARKING MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS TO THE CITY'S NEIGHBORHOODS MOST ADVERSELY IMPACTED BY PARKING. OVER THE LAST SEVERALYEARS, CCF HAS USED THESE FUNDS TO INITIATE PLACE-BASED STRATEGIC INITIATIVES THAT INCLUDE NEW PEDESTRIAN LIGHTING, CORNER PLANTERS, AND CREATIVE BIKE RACKS.</Desc>
